==History==
2017
*The Night Witch was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Night Witch Draft Challenge]] which started on 26/5/2017. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Night Witch. If the player achieved 12 wins, they obtained the Night Witch early.
*The Night Witch [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 31/5/2017.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], decreased the Night Witch's [[Bats]] spawned upon death to 3 (from 4), increased her spawn time interval to 6 seconds (from 5 seconds), and added a 1.5 second delay in her first spawn.
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Night Witch's damage by 9%, decreased her range to 1.65 tiles (from 1.85 tiles), increased her spawn time interval to 7 seconds (from 6 seconds), and decreased the Bats spawned upon death to 2 (from 3).
2018
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the first spawn time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.5 seconds), increased her Bats' attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second), and increased their first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Night Witch from Frozen Peak to Spell Valley.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Night Witch's range to 1.6 tiles (from 1.65 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long.
*On 7/10/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/10/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Night Witch's Bats spawned upon death to 4 (from 2).
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Night Witch's card info screen.
2020
*On 7/1/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Night WItch's first attack time interval to 0.75 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) and increased the first spawn time interval to 3.5 seconds (from 1.3 seconds).
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Bats' attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.1 seconds), and increased their first attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.6 seconds).
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bats' first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Night Witch from Spell Valley to Serenity Peak.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the first spawn time interval to 1 second (from 3.5 seconds), decreased her spawn time interval to 5 seconds (from 7 seconds), and removed the Night Witch's death spawn.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13). The "''even after death''" words from her description were also removed.
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], made it so that the [[Ram Rider]]'s snare ability would no longer affect the spawn speed of the Night Witch.
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Night Witch's attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 30/9/2022, a maintenance break, changed the Night Witch's card image.
2023
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], allowed the Night Witch to spawn 1 Bat after death.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Night Witch's hitpoints by 0.11%. It also fixed a bug where the Bat would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]].

